      "body": "Add 6 synthetic regression cases for the existing JavaScript runtime and a separately named product-runtime workflow. The quality guide links native CI runs and explains the measured scope.\n\nValidation: all 6 tests passed locally on Node 24.11.0, including native V8 coverage. Existing runtime files, public exports, package manifest, lockfile, license, and repository-policy workflow are byte-for-byte unchanged. No package installation or release is performed by the new workflow.\n\nResolved by hathq/ihat-store-core#4: the source adapter and all six native regression cases are maintained under packages/ihat-store-source and pass the owner CI. This legacy repository remains archived.",
